    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so much more real than just \"coincidence\" or \"environmental factors.\" it's like i'm trying to contain it but it just leaks out when i can't help it. if i can't prove it with science right now, i still have to deal with the reality of it happening. do u think there are any ways to, i don't know, stabilize my energy or manage my aura or something? i just want to stop making things glitch out every time i have a bad day.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
