      "content": "Since your goal is to manage the intense physical reactions associated with stress, focus on established stress-reduction techniques rather than metaphysical concepts. Practicing deep, diaphragmatic breathing exercises can significantly calm the nervous system during moments of rising anger or anxiety. Incorporating mindfulness or short breaks throughout your workday can help prevent those intense emotional surges from occurring in the first place.",
